= LibreSign Brand Manual

Freedom and control for electronic signing. This manual is generated from open, version-controlled source.

#v(12pt)

= Name and meaning

*LibreSign* is the official spelling.

“Libre” expresses freedom to operate signing infrastructure, control documents and data, inspect and adapt the software, integrate it, and choose how it is maintained.

= Pronunciation

“Libre” begins with an /i/ sound, not the English diphthong in “lie”.

- Libre: /ˈli.bɾe/
- LibreSign: /ˈli.bɾe saɪn/

